--- a/VERIFICATION_QUALITY_HOTFIX.md
+++ b/VERIFICATION_QUALITY_HOTFIX.md
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# PixelForge Studio 0.9.2 — Fidelity Quality Hotfix
+
+## Intent
+
+Replace the simplified recovery rendering experience with the full Milestone-9 PixelForge pipeline and make the default Fidelity preset deliberately pixel-art oriented.
+
+## Fidelity Pro contract
+
+- 128 px maximum art grid
+- 24-color automatic palette
+- no blanket dithering
+- portrait detail protection enabled
+- structural detail analysis enabled
+- Pro V2 perceptual tone matching enabled
+- strong micro-cluster cleanup
+- conservative palette-ramp anti-jaggy refinement
+- legacy engine path remains available through persisted pre-M9 project settings
+
+## Release boundary
+
+An APK is not considered deliverable until core smoke, Android unit tests, `assembleDebug`, APK signature/badging/ZIP checks, and emulator launch smoke all pass on the SDK-37 runner.
